Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:31.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“The exception is compute:
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:31.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}people pay for servers”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think I agree as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:04.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,The only exception is if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:05.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,what you're building has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to do with compute
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's probably not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,something that you want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,or that you have to open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:12.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,source, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,So like for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,anyone can go run CI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can run it on your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,laptop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,But what you really need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,is you need a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:19.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,servers. You need a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,of vCPUs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:22.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,right? you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,inherently you want it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be hosted but you can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:26.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,self-host right so yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think compute is still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:29.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,something that you want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,to pay for generally
